0170-onc-exec-inject-envc -- THE FIX: register injected env vars.

exec_add_user_string() writes the string but does not bump ip_envc; dyld walks
envp[] using ip_envc so the injected DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES was invisible.
Add ip_envc++/ip_argspace accounting for the injected var and the two print
vars, matching R1's 0006-bsd-process.patch.  Only bsd/kern/kern_exec.c.

